      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This was an issue during beta and part of the reason we filter out non-GenericTracker devices. It sounds like it's still causing crashing though (even if it didn't cause crashing if it were filtered out it would then just not work). This may get fixed in the processes of looking into other similar issues, but also I have to note that we don't explicitly support tracking setups like this. So in the near term if it's causing crashing I'd recommend not using the LIV emulated tracker.",
