      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: Hello there, I've paid for VRC+ to support you guys and now I can't play the game with FBT now because of your decision to not support hybrid FBT setups. A lot of us are like Nikka, we can't afford proper Vive trackers because overpricing outside of the States. Please consider fixing this.",
