      "value": "@{618bd7dd40556f253ad5f238|full_name}: I live in Brazil, where VR and technology in general is taxed in really high prices and our currency exchange is absurd. A lot of people in here use hybrid setups because of that. I've played VRC the first time back in 2017 and that's how long it took me to get a proper FBT (Literally got it last month), And now VRC keeps crashing and doesn't allow me to play with the setup I've spent a lot of money to have. That just makes extremely frustrated since I never had problems with the LIV software and for whatever reason it now became a game crasher. Like said before, I believe such an issue shouldn't be big of a deal considering it never has been an issue in the past. I'll be waiting and hopefully it'll be fixed really soon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
